  fanout e_deliver@-->|"③ 실시간<br/>전달"| receiver
  fanout e_memory@-->|"본문 참조"| memory
  receiver e_subscribe@-.->|"cursor로 재구독"| recovery
  recovery e_history@-.->|"④ 누락 메시지 조회"| records
  recovery e_replay@-.->|"복구 전송"| fanout
